      "id": "a2_d",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 1223,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 45,
      "text": "A worker can't end until its artifact bundle exists.\nE2E requires e2e.md + capture.md + manual.md + trace.\n3 refusals → GATE-FAILED, never a silent hang.",
