    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "L_cost",
      "x": 1920,
      "y": 372.8362614158541,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 82.5,
      "text": "Exact token counts harvested from UTC session\ntranscripts — counted, never guessed. Mandatory\nafter every phase: emit usage, price the run total,\ncompare with max_cost_usd. Under → next phase.\nOver → budget_exceeded + exit 2; HALT and wait.\nClose-out telemetry still rolls up the whole run.",
      "originalText": "Exact token counts harvested from UTC session\ntranscripts — counted, never guessed. Mandatory\nafter every phase: emit usage, price the run total,\ncompare with max_cost_usd. Under → next phase.\nOver → budget_exceeded + exit 2; HALT and wait.\nClose-out telemetry still rolls up the whole run.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "roughness": 0,
