      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "① PULL  (kickoff · step 0d)\n\norchestrator.py figma-pull\n• parses PRD §7 Design contract\n  → surface → node-id\n• figma-api.sh image + nodes\n  (token from .env, never config)\n\n→ docs/ai/figma/<prd>/  TRACKED\n   <surface>.png + .tokens.json",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "① PULL  (kickoff · step 0d)\n\norchestrator.py figma-pull\n• parses PRD §7 Design contract\n  → surface → node-id\n• figma-api.sh image + nodes\n  (token from .env, never config)\n\n→ docs/ai/figma/<prd>/  TRACKED\n   <surface>.png + .tokens.json",
