      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "HOOKS — what / where / when\n\nGIT HOOK\n  post-commit  (.git/hooks/, via install-hooks)\n  → fires AFTER every commit; auto-logs the\n     commit event (real SHA + phase). Not the\n     agent's memory — git calls it.\n\nWORKER HOOKS  (per-worker --settings; scripts/hooks/)\n  Stop · stop-gate.sh  → on turn-end: a worker\n     CAN'T stop without its artifacts — e2e.md,\n     capture.md, manual.md, run.zip  + figma-\n     compare.md when ORCH_FIGMA=1 (a UI phase).\n  PreToolUse(Bash) · git-fence.sh  → before every\n     Bash: denies git commit/push/reset\n     (what makes autonomous mode safe).",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "HOOKS — what / where / when\n\nGIT HOOK\n  post-commit  (.git/hooks/, via install-hooks)\n  → fires AFTER every commit; auto-logs the\n     commit event (real SHA + phase). Not the\n     agent's memory — git calls it.\n\nWORKER HOOKS  (per-worker --settings; scripts/hooks/)\n  Stop · stop-gate.sh  → on turn-end: a worker\n     CAN'T stop without its artifacts — e2e.md,\n     capture.md, manual.md, run.zip  + figma-\n     compare.md when ORCH_FIGMA=1 (a UI phase).\n  PreToolUse(Bash) · git-fence.sh  → before every\n     Bash: denies git commit/push/reset\n     (what makes autonomous mode safe).",
